Files: github.com/yuin/goldmark/*
Copyright: 2019 Yusuke Inuzuka
License: Expat
Comment: goldmark, the Markdown renderer, statically linked into the binary.

Files: github.com/alecthomas/chroma/v2/*
Copyright: 2017 Alec Thomas
License: Expat
Comment: chroma, the syntax lexer, statically linked into the binary.

Files: github.com/dlclark/regexp2/v2/*
Copyright: Doug Clark
 Microsoft Corporation
License: Expat
Comment: regexp2, chroma's regular expression engine, statically linked
 into the binary. Parts are ported from Microsoft's dotnet/corefx.

Files: github.com/unixfile/kv/*
Copyright: 2026 unixfile
License: Expat
Comment: kv, the keyval library that converts between JSON, YAML and
 keyval, statically linked into the binary.

